# amux Cloud: the business this week

From the collected files, state in under 200 words: cash collected and refunded, new and lapsed customers,
waitlist and pricing-page viewers, provisioning health, backups, and anything a file marks as not measured.
Name the one number that moved most against last week. Do not guess a number a file does not contain.
